## Part B: 优化模式目录

以下是每种 bottleneck_type 对应的 Go 代码改造策略，作为 MCTS 展开时的候选空间：

| bottleneck_type | 候选策略 | 具体手段 | 适用条件 | 预期改善 |
|----------------|---------|---------|---------|---------|
| serialization | pooling, library_swap, lazy_parse | sonic.Encoder + sync.Pool / json.RawMessage 按需解析 | flat% > 10% 或单次 Marshal > 1ms | flat% 降 50-70% |
| gc_pressure | pooling, reduce_pointer, go_gc_tune | sync.Pool + Reset() / 值类型替代指针 / GOGC=200 | runtime.mallocgc flat > 10% 或 gcMarkWorker cum > 10% | GC CPU 降 30-50% |
| lock_contention | sharding, rwmutex, atomic, shrink_crit | 分片锁 map[uint32]*Mutex / RWMutex 读多写少 / atomic.Value / 缩小临界区 | mutex profile cum > 20% | 锁等待降 50-80% |
| syscall_overhead | batching, buffering | 批量 syscall / bufio.Writer | syscall.Syscall flat > 10% | syscall 次数降 80%+ |
| network_io | conn_pool, batch_flush, timeout | http.Client 复用 Transport / 批量 flush / context timeout | net.Conn.Write flat > 5% | 连接建立开销降 90%+ |
| database | batch, prepared, deadline | 批量查询 / prepared statement 复用 / context.WithTimeout | database/sql 在 top 中出现 | DB 等待降 40-60% |
| memory_alloc | preallocate, escape_fix | make([]T, 0, cap) / const key 避免 map 分配 | runtime.growslice 或 mapassign flat > 5% | 分配次数降 60-90% |
| memory_leak | close_resources, ttl | defer resp.Body.Close() / 定时清理全局 cache | goroutine profile 中 inuse 持续增长 | 内存占用回归正常 |
| goroutine_leak | worker_pool, errgroup, ctx | errgroup + context / 有界 worker pool / select + done channel | goroutine count 单调增长或 >10000 | goroutine 数稳定 |
| string_concat | builder | strings.Builder + Grow() / 预分配 []byte | fmt.Sprintf 或 + 拼接在 hot path | 字符串操作 CPU 降 60-80% |
| reflection | codegen, concrete | 代码生成替代 reflect / 具体类型替代 interface{} | encoding/json 或 reflect 包在 top 中 | 反射开销降 80%+ |
| regexp | compile_cache | 全局 regexp.MustCompile 替代函数内 Compile | regexp 包 flat > 5% | 正则编译开销降 99% |
| interface_boxing | generics, concrete | 泛型替代 interface{} / 具体类型 | runtime.convT2I 或 assertI2T flat > 3% | 装箱开销降 70%+ |
| escape_heap | value_semantics | 传值替代传指针 / 小对象栈分配 | escape analysis 报告 unexpected heap alloc | 堆分配降 50-80% |

每种策略的具体 Go 代码改写示例：

### pooling 示例
```go
// before: 每次请求分配新的 encoder
func (h *Handler) Serve(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {
    var resp Response
    json.NewEncoder(w).Encode(resp)
}

// after: sync.Pool 复用
var encoderPool = sync.Pool{New: func() any { return json.NewEncoder(nil) }}

func (h *Handler) Serve(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {
    enc := encoderPool.Get().(*json.Encoder)
    defer encoderPool.Put(enc)
    enc.Reset(w)
    enc.Encode(resp)
}
```

### preallocate 示例
```go
// before: 动态扩容
var items []Item
for rows.Next() { items = append(items, scan(rows)) }

// after: 预分配
items := make([]Item, 0, expectedCount)
```

### sharding 示例
```go
// before: 单锁
type Cache struct { mu sync.Mutex; data map[string]any }

// after: 分片锁（32 片）
type Cache struct { shards [32]shard }
type shard struct { mu sync.Mutex; data map[string]any }
```

### builder 示例
```go
// before: +
s := ""
for _, v := range items { s += v.Name + "," }

// after: strings.Builder + Grow
var b strings.Builder
b.Grow(estimatedSize)
for _, v := range items { b.WriteString(v.Name); b.WriteByte(',') }
s := b.String()
```

### compile_cache 示例
```go
// before: 函数内编译
func Match(s string) bool { return regexp.MustCompile(`\d+`).MatchString(s) }

// after: 全局缓存
var numRE = regexp.MustCompile(`\d+`)
func Match(s string) bool { return numRE.MatchString(s) }
```

